# Direct dependencies of the Atheris fuzz harnesses (see fuzz/ and
# .github/workflows/fuzz.yml). Only what `import backpropagate` needs on a CPU
# runner: torch / transformers / trl / peft are imported lazily by the library
# and are deliberately absent, so a fuzz run installs in seconds, not minutes.
#
# Regenerate fuzz.txt (hash-pinned) from this file with:
#   uvx --from uv@latest uv pip compile --generate-hashes --python-version 3.12 --python-platform x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu requirements/fuzz.in -o requirements/fuzz.txt
atheris
filelock
packaging
pydantic
pydantic-settings
tenacity
